WEBVTT

00:04:27.164 --> 00:04:30.233
In a survey conducted
by the Pew Research Center,

00:04:30.267 --> 00:04:34.905
they found that one in three Americans
say that blackface is always

00:04:34.938 --> 00:04:37.207
or sometimes OK

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:39.509
if it's used in a Halloween costume.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.945
So let me ask this question.

00:04:42.579 --> 00:04:45.582
What is the appeal of darkening one's skin

00:04:45.615 --> 00:04:48.618
in order to impersonate someone
of a different race?

00:04:49.486 --> 00:04:53.089
Blackface minstrelsy was born
out of the realities of slavery

00:04:53.123 --> 00:04:55.225
and racial segregation,

00:04:55.225 --> 00:04:58.929
and its continual reappearance
echoes the pain and suffering

00:04:58.929 --> 00:05:00.397
felt by Black people